e wild in Borneo. People rescued them from big fires. On Friday, they went free in a reserve in the west.", "Three mothers, their three daughters and two adult males went free. In August and September, fires burned their forest home.", "Indonesian wildlife workers saved 46 of these apes. Orangutans are in great danger. Only a few live in the world now."], "paragraphs_zh": ["八只红毛猩猩回到了婆罗洲的野外。人们从大火中救出了它们。星期五，它们在西部的一个保护区里重获自由。", "三只妈妈、它们的三个女儿和两只成年雄性重获自由。八月和九月，大火烧毁了它们的森林家园。", "印尼野生动物工作人员救下了46只这种猿类。红毛猩猩处境非常危险。现在世界上只剩下很少了。"], "body": "Eight orangutans are back in the wild in Borneo. People rescued them from big fires. On Friday, they went free in a reserve in the west.\n\nThree mothers, their three daughters and two adult males went free. In August and September, fires burned their forest home.\n\nIndonesian wildlife workers saved 46 of these apes. Orangutans are in great danger. Only a few live in the world now.", "body_zh": "八只红毛猩猩回到了婆罗洲的野外。人们从大火中救出了它们。星期五，它们在西部的一个保护区里重获自由。\n\n三只妈妈、它们的三个女儿和两只成年雄性重获自由。八月和九月，大火烧毁了它们的森林家园。\n\n印尼野生动物工作人员救下了46只这种猿类。红毛猩猩处境非常危险。现在世界上只剩下很少了。", "text": "Eight orangutans are back in the wild in Borneo. People rescued them from big fires. On Friday, they went free in a reserve in the west. Three mothers, their three daughters and two adult males went free. In August and September, fires burned their forest home. Indonesian wildlife workers saved 46 of these apes. Orangutans are in great danger. Only a few live in the world now.", "vocab": [{"word": "orangutan", "pos": "noun", "zh": "红毛猩猩", "note": "一种大型猿类，生活在东南亚", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "wild", "pos": "noun", "zh": "野外", "note": "in the wild 表示在自然环境中", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "fire", "pos": "noun", "zh": "火；火灾", "note": "复数 fires 指多场火灾", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "rescue", "pos": "verb", "zh": "营救", "note": "过去式 rescued", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "release", "pos": "verb", "zh": "释放", "note": "过去式 released，这里指放归野外", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "r